1271
01:56:29.650 --> 01:56:31.276
MAME: CHO

1272
01:56:31.318 --> 01:56:33.362
KAWA: KOICHI YAMADERA

1273
01:56:33.404 --> 01:56:36.323
lWA: TOSHIYUKI NISHIDA

